    design</size></b>\r\njorge huallpa\nignacio fernandez\r\n\n\n<b><size=120%>music
    & SFX</size></b>\r\ndiego ortiz\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><size=120%>quality assurance</size></b>\r\njuan
    pablo pivetta\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for playing\r\n"
